		"Deleted as flaky (each failed in some full runs and passed in others, often by a 5 s timeout): render.test tabs 'after switching, scrollback and screen hold exactly the focused tab' and modals 'open, typed into and closed in place'; file-changes 'overlapping aliases wait across sessions'; forks 'fork snapshots completed blocks'; turns-retry 'a stream cut off mid-answer continues' and 'a temporary failure retries at once, then backs off'; notify 'a reply's <summary> is its notice line'; spawn 'a subagent waiting for its own reports' and 'a subagent that ends with no text still reports'; slash 'a command question lives beside turns'; turns-stop 'Escape during a command kills it'; and host-transcript.test.ts, whose only test was 'paused: partial output and the pause look the same everywhere'. Their behavior is now untested; a replacement must be deterministic.",
		'Order-dependent, not flaky: the /config modal test timed out only after host.test.ts ran in the same process; bisecting the files that run before it found the leak.'
